// Abstract primitive with an UNANNOTATED (hence non-deterministic, per
// SEMANTICS 6.4 / ruling 7.A.6) Int-valued method. Each invocation of f
// resolves its non-determinism with fresh i.i.d. coins. Used by Attack A5
// of the HoistGroupExpToInitialize audit.
Primitive Noise() {
    Int f(Int x);
}
